Package: qore
Architecture: any
Depends: libqore20 (= ${binary:Version}),
         qore-stdlib (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ca-certificates
Suggests: qore-debug-tools (= ${source:Version}),
          qore-doc,
          qore-misc-tools
Description: multithreaded programming language
 Qore is a scripting language supporting threading and embedded logic, designed
 for applying a flexible scripting-based approach to enterprise interface
 development but is also useful as a general purpose language.

Package: libqore20
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared library for the Qore runtime and clients
 Qore is a scripting language supporting threading and embedded logic, designed
 for applying a flexible scripting-based approach to enterprise interface
 development but is also useful as a general purpose language.
 .
 This package provides the qore library required for all clients using qore
 functionality.

